+From: T95H local port
+Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: backport AC200 Ethernet support to Linux 6.12
+
+Source: tested T95H Linux 7.2.3 driver tree. Preserve driver SPDX/authorship.
+Adapt PHY matching, regulator lookup and PWM callbacks to the 6.12 APIs.
+Vendor autonomous EEE is disabled by config_init, including resume.
+The T95H DTS mirrors the package regulator onto the PHY consumer node.
+
+--- a/drivers/mfd/Kconfig
++++ b/drivers/mfd/Kconfig
